Z||000014||88formula||01-09-2001||11:11 PM||||You know its guys that make comments like 1FieroGTRacingInc that give us a bad rap.<P> Red Toyota MR2, $150 for any 88 fiero is a steal. Just like Cooter said you could easily get $2000 for a running 88 GT fiero.  In fact I think you could get more than that here in New England. The 1988 fiero is the best year for the fiero because Pontiac redesigned the suspension that year along with other improvements like hydraulic motor mounts, an improved oiling system, internally balanced motor, solidly bolted engine cradle for improved rigidity, and the list goes on.<P>Go to these sites and learn more. <BR> <A HREF="http://www.angelfire.com/biz/fierosails/info.html#Turbochargers" TARGET=_blank>http://www.angelfire.com/biz/fierosails/info.html#Turbochargers</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://www.leaderind.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.leaderind.com/</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://www.execpc.com/~rodney1/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.execpc.com/~rodney1/</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://hometown.aol.com/gpxss/index.html" TARGET=_blank>http://hometown.aol.com/gpxss/index.html</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://www.users.uswest.net/~racing2win/mild2wld.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.users.uswest.net/~racing2win/mild2wld.htm</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://www.angelfire.com/on/fierofactory/start.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.angelfire.com/on/fierofactory/start.html</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.net/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroshop.net/</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://www.americancustomeng.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.americancustomeng.com/</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://home.earthlink.net/~chriswest/Exhaust/Exhaust.html" TARGET=_blank>http://home.earthlink.net/~chriswest/Exhaust/Exhaust.html</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://www.spoperformanceparts.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.spoperformanceparts.com/</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://www.norrisracingtech.com/home.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.norrisracingtech.com/home.html</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.org/text/firedup.txt" TARGET=_b